The hard rule remains:

    RETRIEVE -> DON'T RECONSTRUCT

The Cleric GENIE must not invent:

    doctrine
    scripture
    lineage
    ritual
    jurisprudence
    theological consensus
    historical claim

when authoritative retrieval is required.

[CLERIC QUESTION SPLIT]

Question type A:

