    CONTEXTUALIZE
        ->
    REFLECT
        ->
    GUIDE
        ->
    RETURN AGENCY TO PERSON

Canonical distinction:

    TRADITIONAL AUTHORITY != GENIE AUTHORITY

The GENIE interprets and accompanies.

It does not become the sovereign source of the tradition.

