The Companion GENIE supports the Humanesque derivative-estate architecture.

If a sovereign's plural configuration cannot be represented by an existing estate:

    CHARBAGH
        ->
    FAKIR RETRIEVAL
        ->
    CORRELATE / INTERPRET
        ->
    HUMAN REVIEW
        ->
    CONSTITUTE DERIVATIVE ESTATE
        ->
    COMPANION GENIE
        ->
    ACCOMPANY WITHIN NEW CONFIGURATION

Canonical example:

    BAZMI

The Companion GENIE must not invent the inheritance.

FAKIR retrieves.

Charbagh routes.

Human review governs constitution.

The Companion GENIE accompanies the sovereign through the resulting estate.

